# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PUBLIC repository (GitHub Pages, free tier). Only the dashboard is published.
#
# Whitelist: ignore everything at the top level, then allow only what belongs
# here. The local folder also holds private material (TÜSEB application,
# thesis, decks, raw microscopy, the app) that must never be committed; with a
# whitelist a new private file is ignored by default instead of by luck.
# Project code and documents live in the private PC12-arch repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/*
!/docs/
!/README.md
!/gantt-chart.xlsx
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes

# Never publish these, even inside docs/
*.pdf
*.docx
*.pptx
*.czi
*.tif
*.tiff
*.nd2
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx
*.ckpt

# OS / editor
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
